1055 0 obj
<<
/Type /StructElem
/S /P
/P 73 0 R
/E (As per RBI guidelines applicable from time to time. Interest will be calculated on a daily product basis. Interest will be credited to the account at quarterly intervals. Interest will be paid only if it works out to Re 1/-or more. There after fifty paise and more will be rounded off to the next higher rupee and anything less will be ignored. In case of accounts frozen by the enforcement authorities, "Bank shall continue to credit the interest to the account on a regular basis. ")
/Pg 16 0 R
/K [34]
>>
